{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a light Rogue-like deck-building game that allows players to deeply customize core content such as cards, skills, and levels. With built-in Steam Workshop support, players can use convenient creation tools to quickly design and share their own content, easily uploading it to the community and experiencing endless possibilities for content expansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card Editing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can freely edit cards using the built-in editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086590/extras/241134b4df3c543c7b86f12ca8aab90a.avif?t=1762425690\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Data Management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can manage game data using the built-in data management tools. This includes, but is not limited to, creating new skills, new gameplay mechanics, new levels, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086590/extras/2ede43652d05c5f8c1e993b61d231c74.avif?t=1762425690\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workshop</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use the game's built-in workshop feature to upload or download custom content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086590/extras/203ece8f52c99b3ab5856f02a79e1c65.avif?t=1762425690\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086590?t=1762425690","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086590/11b453104b9cd677bd2f252770c8e0ed88e22d5f/pa